# Development: leave VITE_API_URL unset — Vite proxies /api to localhost:3000.
#
# Production (Render Static Site on site.safariomni.com):
# Set at BUILD time (Environment → Build):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://safariomni.com
#   VITE_STAFF_ERP_URL=https://www.safariomni.com/login
# Do not append /api — paths already include /api/public/...
